<!--Q3-->
<exercise>
  <problem>
    <para> Explain your reasoning. </para>
    </problem><solution>
    
    <para>Enter your answer here:</para>
  <para>Compare your answer:</para>
    <para>Your answer may vary, but here is a sample. The graph shows that the more sod she purchases, the less flower beds she will be able to purchase.</para>
  </solution></exercise>
